Hanumān views gold-vaidūrya latticed mansion like lightning cloud --- Hanumān sees armories moon terraces and Maya-built houses --- Hanumān admires peerless Puṣpaka like heaven on earth --- Hanumān notes crafted geese elephants and lotus Lakṣmī --- Hanumān roams Rāvaṇa-guarded city but misses Jānakī and sorrows
